{"articleNo":"70584","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=70584&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 1학기 가계곤란자 등 생활관 입사 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.27","hit":"6104","attachments":[{"name":"일반입사신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70584&attachNo=2920"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2013-1학기 가계곤란자 등 생활관 입사 신청을 다음과 같이 안내하오니 해당자는 기한 내에 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">1. 신청 기간 : 2012.12.05(수)～12.10(월) 17:00까지</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">2. 신청 대상</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 기초생활 수급자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 차상위계층자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 한부모 가족(주민센터 발급에 한함)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 장애인(본인)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 국가보훈대상자(국가유공, 독립유공 등)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">3. 제출 서류 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 생활관 입사 신청서 1부(생활관 홈페이지-생활안내-각종 양식-일반입사신청서 다운로드)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 대상 서류명 (해당 서류 중 1부)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 주민센터 발급 : 기초생활 수급자 증명서, 차상위계층 증명서, 한부모가족 증명서, 장애인(본인)증명서</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가보훈처 발급 : 국가유공자유족확인원 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">4. 제출 장소 : 푸름관 행정실</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">5. 기타</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 공공기관 발급 서류에 한 함(주민등록등본으로 한부모 가족 신청 불가, 건강보험료로 가계곤란 증명 불가)&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 배정인원 보다 신청자가 많을 경우 성적순으로 선발</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 금액적 혜택은 없으며 선발 기회 우선적 부여</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">2012. 11.&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
